1ltt|n|Having the quality or power of producing; yielding or furnishing results; as, productive soil; productive enterprises; productive labor, that which increases the number or amount of products. ; Bringing into being; causing to exist; producing; originative; as, an age productive of great men; a spirit productive of heroic achievements. ; Producing, or able to produce, in large measure; fertile; profitable.	a:g45,41,1~g45,41,1
