1luk|a|Of or pertaining to a profession, or calling; conforming to the rules or standards of a profession; following a profession; as, professional knowledge; professional conduct. ; Engaged in by professionals; as, a professional race; -- opposed to amateur.	j:16p3,80,5;13p8,68,5;1oas,53,3;1vtz,53,23;5e5,53,3;1hww,53,2;238z,52,5;g3t,51,10;ddf,51,5;nmt,47,3~xbo,7,33;1vtz,53,23;qdb,3,21;163a,17,19;jls,33,18;1vu0,33,17;ii9,5,16;1p8i,22,13;pk6,25,12;g3t,51,10	e:1yc2,26,8~1yc2,26,8
